# Review ownership for UmutKorkmaz/meridian.
#
# This file names who is asked to review. By itself it enforces nothing: a code-owner
# review blocks a merge only when branch protection or a ruleset turns on "Require
# review from Code Owners". The read-only check on 2026-10-23 found no required
# reviews, no required status checks and no rulesets on `main`; see
# docs/governance/required-checks.md and docs/governance/branch-protection.md.
#
# There is one maintainer. No second maintainer exists yet, so every pattern below names
# the same account. When a real second maintainer is onboarded (docs/PLAN.md §8.4,
# docs/maintainer-checklist.md), add them at least to the security-sensitive paths.
# Later patterns take precedence over earlier ones.

# Default ownership.
* @UmutKorkmaz

# Security-sensitive hot paths: changes to the mapping execution engine and the
# mediator pipeline require explicit attention (docs/PLAN.md quality gates).
/src/Meridian.Mapping/Execution/   @UmutKorkmaz
/src/Meridian.Mediator/Pipeline/   @UmutKorkmaz
/src/Meridian.Mediator/Wrappers/   @UmutKorkmaz

# Source generators: diagnostics, emitted code and the C# 12 consumer floor.
/src/Meridian.Mapping.Generators/  @UmutKorkmaz
/src/Meridian.Mediator.Generators/ @UmutKorkmaz

